{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>אורח</b> — to find life is the keeping of discipline." "<b>ועוזב התוכחת</b> — he leads others astray." "Another interpretation: <b>שומר מוסר ועוזב תוכחת מתעה</b> — they will reprove him to lead astray; also <b>ארח חיים</b>, and the interpretation is very good."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:21:58.608007981Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}